'''Blossoming''' (花見, ''Hanami'', '''Flower Viewing''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

